<div data-cgap-sector="Schools, Theaters &amp; Maker Spaces" data-cgap-term="school"></div><p class="lead">Schools put new users in front of real equipment every day: a table saw in the wood shop, a welder in ag mechanics, a laser cutter in the maker space and a fly system over the stage. The sign at the machine is often the last reminder before a student makes a mistake.</p><p>These signs are written for those spots, including wood and metal shops, CNC and laser cutters, science labs and chemical storage, kiln and glass rooms, stage rigging and followspots, gyms and bleachers, and the boiler room. They are 8x12 aluminum, so they stay up and stay readable through years of classes.</p><h2>What to post, and where</h2><div class="il-areas"><div class="il-area"><h3>Wood shop</h3><p>Saws, jointers, planers and sanders. 97 signs. Typical spot: On sander hood.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-drum-sander-sign-8x12-aluminum">Drum Sander</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-woodshop-jointer-sign-cgap-w00729-812">Woodshop Jointer</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-wood-lathe-sign-cgap-c02104-812">Wood Lathe</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-jointer-fence-sign-cgap-n03249-812">Jointer Fence</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Metal shop and welding</h3><p>Welding booths, forges, grinders and metal lathes. 123 signs. Typical spot: Above forge hood.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-coal-forge-sign-8x12-aluminum">Coal Forge</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-engine-lathe-sign-cgap-w19865-812">Engine Lathe</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-welding-table-sign-cgap-c02779-812">Welding Table</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-metal-shop-shear-sign-cgap-n15504-812">Metal Shop Shear</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Laser cutters, CNC and 3D printers</h3><p>Maker space and fab lab equipment. 68 signs. Typical spot: On projector mount.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-show-laser-sign-8x12-aluminum">Show Laser</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-laser-cutter-sign-cgap-w03136-812">Laser Cutter</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-cnc-router-bit-sign-cgap-c06549-812">CNC Router Bit</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-3d-printer-farm-sign-cgap-n05541-812">3D Printer Farm</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Science labs and chemical storage</h3><p>Chemistry rooms, fume hoods and chemical storage. 56 signs. Typical spot: Near lab master gas valve.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-lab-gas-jets-sign-8x12-aluminum">Lab Gas Jets</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-lab-gas-hose-connection-sign-cgap-w06335-812">Lab Gas Hose Connection</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-fume-hood-sash-sign-cgap-c12744-812">Fume Hood Sash</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-lab-refrigerator-sign-cgap-n20419-812">Lab Refrigerator</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Kilns, ceramics and glass</h3><p>Kiln rooms, pottery studios and hot glass. 177 signs. Typical spot: Post at raku firing area.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-raku-kiln-sign-8x12-aluminum">Raku Kiln</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-pottery-kiln-sign-cgap-w00733-812">Pottery Kiln</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-kiln-cart-sign-cgap-c05270-812">Kiln Cart</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-annealer-door-sign-cgap-n02511-812">Annealer Door</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Stage rigging and theater</h3><p>Fly systems, catwalks, pit lifts and lighting positions. 231 signs. Typical spot: Prop cage and armory.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-stage-firearms-sign-8x12-aluminum">Stage Firearms</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-hemp-fly-set-pin-sign-cgap-w03132-812">Hemp Fly Set Pin</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-fly-loft-door-sign-cgap-c11735-812">Fly Loft Door</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-stage-winch-sign-cgap-n20016-812">Stage Winch</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Gyms, bleachers and athletics</h3><p>Bleachers, weight rooms, pools and fields. 147 signs. Typical spot: Bleacher understructure openings.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-under-bleachers-sign-8x12-aluminum">Under Bleachers</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-gym-mat-hoist-strap-sign-cgap-w08732-812">Gym Mat Hoist Strap</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-bleacher-aisle-sign-cgap-c19195-812">Bleacher Aisle</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-pool-uv-system-sign-cgap-n23586-812">Pool UV System</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Fire, exits and emergency gear</h3><p>Extinguishers, eyewash, exits and emergency stops. 26 signs. Typical spot: Mount on the wall or post beside the wall next to the station at eye level.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-eyewash-station-drain-sign-cgap-c13618-812">Eyewash Station Drain</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-laser-cutter-extinguisher-sign-cgap-n15099-812">Laser Cutter Extinguisher</a></li><li><span data-s="SAFETY FIRST">SAFETY FIRST</span><a href="/products/safety-first-pit-extinguisher-sign-cgap-i17621-812">Pit Extinguisher</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-prep-room-eyewash-station-sign-cgap-n19409-812">Prep Room Eyewash Station</a></li></ul></div></div><h2>Common questions</h2><div class="il-faq"><details><summary>What safety signs should a school wood shop have?</summary><p>Post signs at each machine for guards, eye protection and keeping hands clear, plus reminders where students should not start a machine on their own. Search the machine name, like &quot;table saw&quot; or &quot;jointer&quot;, to see the options.</p></details><details><summary>Do you have signs for theaters and stage rigging?</summary><p>Yes, including counterweight arbors, fly rails, orchestra pit lifts, catwalks and followspots. Search &quot;stage rigging&quot; or &quot;fly system&quot;.</p></details><details><summary>Are these signs good for maker spaces and libraries too?</summary><p>Yes. Laser cutters, 3D printers, CNC routers and soldering stations all have signs written for them.</p></details></div><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "FAQPage", "mainEntity": [{"@type": "Question", "name": "What safety signs should a school wood shop have?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Post signs at each machine for guards, eye protection and keeping hands clear, plus reminders where students should not start a machine on their own. Search the machine name, like \"table saw\" or \"jointer\", to see the options."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do you have signs for theaters and stage rigging?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes, including counterweight arbors, fly rails, orchestra pit lifts, catwalks and followspots. Search \"stage rigging\" or \"fly system\"."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Are these signs good for maker spaces and libraries too?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. Laser cutters, 3D printers, CNC routers and soldering stations all have signs written for them."}}]}</script>